# Dataset Description

## Domain

Supply Chain Analytics

## Business Context

AtliQ Mart is a growing FMCG company focused on improving customer service levels and operational efficiency.

## Objective

Analyze delivery performance using key service-level metrics:

- OTIF (On Time In Full)
- OT (On Time)
- IF (In Full)
- LIFR (Line Fill Rate)
- VOFR (Volume Fill Rate)

## Analysis Dimensions

- Customer
- Product
- City
- Order
- Time Period
